    "Ziyarat of the Martyrs of Uhud\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA RASOOLILLAAH\nPeace be upon Allah’s Messenger.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى نَبِيِّ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA NABIYYILLAAH\nPeace be upon Allah’s Prophet.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدِ بْنِ عَبْدِ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA MUHAMMADIBNI A'BDILLAAH\nPeace be upon Muhammad the son of `Abdullah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰۤى اَهْلِ بَيْتِهِ الطَّاهِرِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA AHLI BAYTIHIT TAAHIREEN\npeace be upon his Immaculate Household.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ اَيُّهَا الشُّهَدَاۤءُ الْمُؤْمِنُوْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKUM AYYUHASH SHUHADAA'UL MU'MINOON\nPeace be upon you, O martyrs, believing ones.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ يَاۤ اَهْلَ بَيْتِ الْاِيْمَانِ وَالتَّوْحِيْدِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKUM YAA AHLA BAYTIL EEMAANI WAT TAWHEED\nPeace be upon you, O household of (true) faith and monotheism.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ يَاۤ اَنْصَارَ دِيْنِ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKUM YAA ANSAARA DEENILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O supporters of Allah’s religion\nوَاَنْصَارَ رَسُوْلِهٖ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهِ السَّلَامُ\nWA ANSAARA RASOOLIHEE A'LAYHI WA AALIHIS SALAAM\nand supporters of His Messenger—peace be upon him and his Household.\nسَلَامٌ عَلَيْكُمْ بِمَا صَبَرْتُمْ\nSALAAMUN A'LAYKUM BIMAA SABARTUM\nPeace be upon you because you were constant!\nفَنِعْمَ عُقْبَى الدَّارِ\nFANI'MA U'QBAD DAAR\nHow excellent is then the issue of the abode.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّ اللّٰهَ اخْتَارَكُمْ لِدِيْنِهٖ\nASH-HADU ANNALLAAHAKH TAARAKUM LIDEENIH\nI bear witness that Allah has chosen you for His religion\nوَاصْطَفَاكُمْ لِرَسُوْلِهٖ\nWASTAFAAKUM LIRASOOLIH\nand selected you for His Messenger.\nوَاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكُمْ قَدْ جَاهَدْتُمْ فِي اللّٰهِ حَقَّ جِهَادِهٖ\nWA ASH-HADU ANNAKUM QAD JAAHADTUM FILLAAHI HAQQA JIHAADIH\nAnd I bear witness that you did strive for the sake of Allah as exactly as required\nوَذَبَبْتُمْ عَنْ دِيْنِ اللّٰهِ وَعَنْ نَبِيِّهٖ\nWA DHABABTUM A'N DEENILLAAHI WA A'N NABIYYIH\ndefended Allah’s religion and Prophet,\nوَجُدْتُمْ بِاَنْفُسِكُمْ دُوْنَهٗ\nWA JUDTUM BI-ANFUSIKUM DOONAH\nand sacrificed your souls for Him.\nوَاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكُمْ قُتِلْتُمْ عَلٰى مِنْهَاجِ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nWA ASH-HADU ANNAKUM QUTILTUM A'LAA MINHAAJI RASOOLILLAAH\nAnd I bear witness that you were killed following the course of Allah’s Messenger;\nفَجَزَاكُمُ اللّٰهُ عَنْ نَبِيِّهٖ\nFAJAZAAKUMULLAAHU A'N NABIYYIH\ntherefore, may Allah reward you, on behalf of His Prophet\nوَعَنِ الْاِسْلَامِ وَاَهْلِهٖ اَفْضَلَ الْجَزَاۤءِ\nWA A'NIL ISLAAMI WA AHLIHEE AFDALAL JAZAA'\nand Islam and the followers of Islam, with the best reward;\nوَعَرَّفَنَا وُجُوْهَكُمْ فِيْ مَحَلِّ رِضْوَانِهٖ\nWA A'RRAFANAA WUJOOHAKUM FEE MAHALLI RIDWAANIH\nand may He make us recognize you by faces at the Place of His Pleasure\nوَمَوْضِعِ اِكْرَامِهٖ\nWA MAWDI'I IKRAAMIH\nand the Abode of His Honoring\nمَعَ النَّبِيِّيْنَ وَالصِّدِّيْقِيْنَ\nMA'AN NABIYYEENA WAS SIDDEEQEEN\nwith the Prophets, the veracious ones,\nوَالشُّهَدَاۤءِ وَالصَّالِحِيْنَ\nWASH SHUHADAA'I WAS SAALIHEEN\nthe martyrs, and the righteous ones;\nوَحَسُنَ اُوْلٰۤئِكَ رَفِيْقًا\nWA HASUNA OOLAA'IKA RAFEEQAA\nand how excellent is the company of those.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكُمْ حِزْبُ اللّٰهِ\nASH-HADU ANNAKUM HIZBULLAAH\nI bear witness that you are the party of Allah\nوَاَنَّ مَنْ حَارَبَكُمْ فَقَدْ حَارَبَ اللّٰهَ\nWA ANNA MAN HAARABAKUM FAQAD HAARABALLAAH\nand that he who fought you had in fact fought against Allah,\nوَاَنَّكُمْ لَمِنَ الْمُقَرَّبِيْنَ الْفَاۤئِزِيْنَ\nWA ANNAKUM LAMINAL MUQARRABEENAL FAA'IZEEN\nand that you are of those who are the nearest (to Almighty Allah) and of those who are triumphant,\nالَّذِيْنَ هُمْ اَحْيَاۤءٌ عِنْدَ رَبِّهِمْ يُرْزَقُوْنَ\nALLADHEENA HUM AHYAA'UN I'NDA RABBIHIM YURZAQOON\nwho are alive and are provided sustenance from their Lord.\nفَعَلٰى مَنْ قَتَلَكُمْ لَعْنَةُ اللّٰهِ\nFA'ALAA MAN QATALAKUM LA'NATULLAAH\nThe curse of Allah be upon those who killed you.\nوَالْمَلَاۤئِكَةِ وَالنَّاسِ اَجْمَعِيْنَ\nWAL MALAA'IKATI WAN NAASI AJMA'EEN\nSo be the curse of the angels and all peoples.\nاَتَيْتُكُمْ يَاۤ اَهْلَ التَّوْحِيْدِ زَاۤئِرًا\nATAYTUKUM YAA AHLAT TAWHEEDI ZAA'IRAA\nO people of Allah’s Oneness, I have come to you, visiting you,\nوَبِحَقِّكُمْ عَارِفًا\nWA BIHAQQIKUM A'ARIFAA\nacknowledging your rights,\nوَبِزِيَارَتِكُمْ اِلَى اللّٰهِ مُتَقَرِّبًا\nWA BIZIYAARATIKUM ILALLAAHI MUTAQARRIBAA\nseeking nearness to Allah through my visit to you,\nوَبِمَا سَبَقَ مِنْ شَرِيْفِ الْاَعْمَالِ\nWA BIMAA SABAQA MIN SHAREEFIL A'MAAL\nand recognizing your honorable deeds\nوَمَرْضِيِّ الْاَفْعَالِ عَالِمًا\nWA MARDIYYIL AF'AALI A'ALIMAA\nand pleasant acts.\nفَعَلَيْكُمْ سَلَامُ اللّٰهِ وَرَحْمَتُهٗ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nFA'ALAYKUM SALAAMULLAAHI WA RAHMATUHOO WA BARAKAATUH\nPeace, mercy, and blessings of Allah be upon you.\nوَعَلٰى مَنْ قَتَلَكُمْ لَعْنَةُ اللّٰهِ وَغَضَبُهٗ وَسَخَطُهٗ\nWA A'LAA MAN QATALAKUM LA'NATULLAAHI WA GHADABUHOO WA SAKHATUH\nCurse, ire, and wrath of Allah be upon those who killed you.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ انْفَعْنِيْ بِزِيَارَتِهِمْ\nALLAAHUMMAN FA'NEE BIZIYAARATIHIM\nO Allah, (please do) grant me advantages for I am visiting them,\nوَثَبِّتْنِيْ عَلٰى قَصْدِهِمْ\nWA THABBITNEE A'LAA QASDIHIM\nmake me stand steadfastly their course,\nوَتَوَفَّنِيْ عَلٰى مَا تَوَفَّيْتَهُمْ عَلَيْهِ\nWA TAWAFFANEE A'LAA MAA TAWAFFAYTAHUM A'LAYH\ndo not grasp my soul before I be carrying the same principles that they carried when You grasped their souls,\nوَاجْمَعْ بَيْنِيْ وَبَيْنَهُمْ\nWAJMA' BAYNEE WA BAYNAHUM\nand include me with their group\nفِيْ مُسْتَقَرِّ دَارِ رَحْمَتِكَ\nFEE MUSTAQARRI DAARI RAHMATIK\nin the unchangeable abode of Your mercy.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكُمْ لَنَا فَرَطٌ\nASH-HADU ANNAKUM LANAA FARAT\nI bear witness that you preceded us\nوَنَحْنُ بِكُمْ لَاحِقُوْنَ\nWA NAHNU BIKUM LAAHIQOON\nand we shall certainly follow you.\nThen recite [Surah al-Qadr](A101) as many times as you can.\nSome scholars add: pray two rak'at at each grave, then leave."
